game item base attributes:

String uniqueID             // Unique identifier. i.e., "SILVER_FORK"
String itemName             // Internal identifier, not unique.  i.e., "fork"
String itemLongName         // Used in console output.  i.e., "silver fork"
String itemCategory         // Type of item: "tool, utensil, food, weapon" etc.

// Other attributes:

String itemMaterial         // i.e., "metal, plastic, glass, wood, etc"
String itemColor            // i.e., "red, black, white, shiny, dull"
String itemSize             // vague size, such as "large, small, medium" etc.
String itemGenShape         // general shape, "round, square, tall, long, short"
String itemGenTemperature   // general "hot, cold, warm"
int itemSpecTemperature     // Number in F or C, like '70' or '20'.


For Compartment_J, lettuce use:

String uniqueID             // Unique identifier. i.e., "SILVER_FORK"
String itemName             // Internal identifier, not unique.  i.e., "fork"
String itemLongName         // Used in console output.  i.e., "silver fork"
String itemAttribute        // A consolidation of material and color "silver, rusty" etc.
String itemCategory         // Type of item: "tool, utensil, food, weapon" etc.
